cutter star ship black-hulled blackhulled hulled~
a star cutter~
A black-hulled star cutter floats silently in the water.~
   The ship's blue-black eventide hull is so sleek that it draws no wake as it
moves through the still surface of the water. At the bow and stern, the vessel
is decorated with a barely-visible filigree that only appears when the light
strikes just so. Glistening argentine nails along the sides of the ship give
the impression of stars as they reflect in the water. At night, the cutter all
but disappears as it sails through the sea.
~
