harness impact~
an impact harness~
An impact harness dangles here.~
   The harness is just big enough for 1 person sitting comfortably. It's
sturdy, but rather heavy, fashioned from argentine metal and strong leather.
Ropes attach it to harnesses for flying animals so that when they are aloft,
the impact harness allows its rider to soar through the sky.
~
